ig's writing and whilst it's not exactly sacrilegious, it does ridicule nicely people's psychological dependency on the existence of and belief in an higher power. It's whimsical not spiritual.	\N	\N	pending	2024-05-12 12:21:46+03	2024-05-12 12:21:46+03
