ard to keep track of why. But the plot settles in and finds it's groove after that and delivers a near perfect conclusion.\r\n\r\n**Score:** _87%_ |\r\n**Verdict:** _Excellent_	\N	\N	pending	2022-11-26 00:27:25+03	2022-11-26 00:27:25+03
