ightful twist at the end, but it's a very long time in the coming and to be perfectly honest, I was just a bit bored. I've never really been in love with this franchise, it's all too repetitive and predictable - and sadly, this is just the same.	\N	\N	pending	2023-03-27 23:57:05+03	2023-03-27 23:57:06+03
