ake this a somewhat average experience. The MCU needs to pick it up this year because it is on a major downward trajectory.\r\n\r\nScore: 52% |\r\nVerdict: Average	\N	\N	pending	2023-02-17 17:05:37+03	2023-02-17 17:05:37+03
