 electrical wiring and plumbing still working was a bit too much. The absolutely worst offence though was how everyone magically survived sitting in the middle of the fire being extinguished by the release of halon gas (or some equivalent). That just brings stupidity (or maybe laziness) in script writing to a whole new level.\r\n\r\nSo, to sum it up, this move could have been a lot better. To me it was saved by The Rock and my love of special effects loaded action movies.	\N	\N	pending	2018-12-16 12:13:55+03	2024-05-16 18:21:17+03
