irst place, and it doesn't really manage that. It picks up in the last fifteen minutes as the messages of teamwork and collaboration start to flow through the narrative but is really too long. It is still worth a watch on a big screen to appreciate the colourful visual effects.	\N	\N	pending	2022-06-20 10:52:02+03	2022-06-20 10:55:26+03
