g lines from a crappy script (which it was) without really caring about delivery.\r\n\r\nOverall this could have been a good, or at least decent, movie but it was brought down by Hollywood’s abysmal stupidity and lack of respect for the audience thinking they are as stupid as certain Hollywood script writers.	\N	\N	pending	2025-12-08 20:09:35+03	2025-12-08 20:09:35+03
