ally fill in many of the puzzling plot-holes that curiously pepper this sci-fi drama. It's portents of the dangers of self growing AI are clearly presented to anyone who is anxious about the automation of our society and of our increasing dependence on that, but again none of that is exactly original either. It's worth a watch, but I was disappointed.	\N	\N	pending	2026-05-03 13:38:40+03	2026-05-03 13:38:40+03
